Cyber Slider is a WordPress plugin based on slick jquery. Plugin providing full page slider, product slider in widget are and normal slider.
It can be use as a testimonial.
Slider demo and usage documenation can be check here. http://demo.cybersourcepk.com/
== Description ==
Cyber Slider is WordPress plguin to create slider for a site with many different options. It have Carousel option, Product Slider optoin
and much more. The plugin have many setting options for admin. 
For detail check the <a href="http://demo.cybersourcepk.com/"> Demo </a>. 
Please post your question and suggestion.

 = Features: =
* Easy to install WordPress plugin
* Translation Ready
* Works with any standards compliant WordPress theme
* Plays well with other Plugins
* 100% Customizable 
* light Weight
* Easy to modify templates

== Installation ==

 
1. Upload the plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/plugin-name` directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress
3. For Further detail setting please have a look on the <a href="http://demo.cybersourcepk.com/documentation/">documenation</a>.

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= Is Cyber Slider supporting a slider in widget area? =

Yes, Please go to widget area and select the proper shortcode to see that slider in action. 

= Can I create multiple sliders at one time ? =

Yes of course you can create as many slider as you like.

